menu "MORI hardware validation"
config MORI_POWER_STAGE_VERIFIED
    bool "Independent electrical gate, limit and clamp checks signed off (permits bench unlock)"
    default n
    help
        Enable only after the emergency stop, sleep pull-down, heartbeat timeout,
        current-limit modification and bus clamp have passed physical checks.
config MORI_ENABLE_BALANCE
    bool "Compile experimental balance arming support"
    default n
    help
        Requires measured axes/signs, calibrated IMU, explicit serial arming,
        nonzero reviewed gains, local fall protection and hardware verification.
config MORI_LCD_ENABLE
    bool "Enable low-priority GC9A01 display test"
    default y
config MORI_HEAD_VERIFIED
    bool "SER0037 centre, direction, linkage and safe pulse range physically verified"
    default n
    help
        Required for any head PWM. The nominal 270 degree mapping is only a
        commissioning starting point. Remove the linkage for first centring.
endmenu
